向提示词。\n\n用户输入：\n\n{{场景描述}}"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [561.473876953125, 589.3511352539062], "pos": [1318.2667236328125, 635.2503051757812], "id": 410, "properties": {}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [383], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [375.4252624511719, 113.39501190185547], "pos": [2001.3291015625, 642.5046997070312], "widgets_values": ["qwen-360-diffusion-2512-int8-bf16-v2.safetensors", 1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 436, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "lora_name"}, "name": "lora_name", "label": "lora_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "lora_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "strength_model"}, "name": "strength_model", "label": "strength_model", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "strength_model"}], "flags": {"disabled": false}, "id": 286, "type": "LoraLoaderModelOnly", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "qwen-360-diffusion-2512-int8-bf16-v2.safetensors", "directory": "loras", "url": "https://huggingface.co/ProGamerGov/qwen-360-diffusion/resolve/main/qwen-360-diffusion-2512-int8-bf16-v2.safetensors"}], "ver": "0.3.49", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoraLoaderModelOnly"}, "order": 12}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [391], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [340, 130], "pos": [2371.53271484375, 947.0175170898438], "widgets_values": ["360 degree panorama with equirectangular projection, a cinematic photorealistic Chinese fantasy scene of an elegant adult celestial woman performing a graceful traditional dance in the heavenly palace above the clouds.\n\nThe viewer stands inside a vast circular white-jade terrace at natural eye level. At the center of the terrace, a beautiful adult East Asian woman dances with an elegant full-body pose. She has a clearly defined delicate face, expressive dark eyes, long black hair arranged in an elaborate traditional updo, and refined golden hair ornaments. Her expression is serene and focused.\n\nShe wears a flowing pale-blue and ivory hanfu decorated with subtle gold embroidery, layered translucent silk sleeves, a fitted celestial sash and delicate embroidered dance shoes. Her long sleeves and silk ribbons sweep through the air in graceful arcs, following the movement of her body. Her hands, fingers, legs and feet are clearly visible and anatomically coherent.\n\nMagnificent celestial palace halls surround the viewer in every direction. White-jade columns, carved stone railings, golden rooftops, curved flying eaves and glowing lanterns form a continuous heavenly architectural complex. Behind the dancer, an enormous open palace gate reveals a grand throne hall illuminated by warm divine light. Side corridors curve naturally around the terrace and continue behind the viewer.\n\nBeyond the railings stretches an endless sea of luminous clouds, with distant mountain peaks and floating palace pavilions rising through the mist. A few white cranes glide through the open sky, while soft flower petals and tiny golden particles drift gently in the air. The upper view reveals a radiant dawn sky with layers of peach, lavender and pale-gold clouds. The lower view contains detailed jade floor tiles, engraved celestial patterns and subtle reflections of the dancer and palace lights.\n\nSoft golden sunrise light passes through the clouds and illuminates the dancer from the side, creating delicate rim lighting around her hair, sleeves and ribbons. Pale blue, ivory, jade white and warm gold form a harmonious celestial color palette. The atmosphere is ethereal, majestic, romantic and peaceful, with realistic silk fabric, polished jade, carved stone, gild